    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": "Practice",
      "id": "153dc249-f62a-46b7-8641-db2c11e5304c"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": "Choose the pronoun",
      "id": "a6fffaae-1b95-400b-9896-49397d0b581d"
    },
    {
      "type": "practice",
      "props": {
        "data": {
          "instruction": "Complete each sentence with the reflexive pronoun.",
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": "Ik voel … niet lekker.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "me"
              ],
              "note": "Ik uses me."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Jij wast … voor het ontbijt.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "je"
              ],
              "note": "Jij uses je."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Hij kleedt … snel aan.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "zich"
              ],
              "note": "Hij uses zich."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Wij vergissen … soms.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "ons"
              ],
              "note": "Wij uses ons."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Jullie voelen … goed.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "je"
              ],
              "note": "Jullie uses je."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Zij wassen … thuis.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "zich"
              ],
              "note": "Zij uses zich."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Vandaag voel ik … beter.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "me"
              ],
              "note": "Inversion changes word order, not the pronoun."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "0a76015c-373f-459b-ab64-87d582dbdf8c"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": "Reflexive or not?",
      "id": "3262db7c-fd92-4c15-863f-33bac515b821"
    },
    {
      "type": "practice",
      "props": {
        "data": {
          "instruction": "Complete each sentence with the correct verb form or reflexive pronoun.",
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": "Ik … me goed. (voelen)",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "voel"
              ],
              "note": "Finite verb for ik."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Wij … ons voor het eten. (wassen)",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "wassen"
              ],
              "note": "Wij form is wassen."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Voel jij … beter?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "je"
              ],
              "note": "The reflexive pronoun remains after subject."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Vandaag … Sofia zich niet lekker. (voelen)",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "voelt"
              ],
              "note": "Fronted time triggers inversion."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Mijn broer … zich snel aan. (aankleden)",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "kleedt"
              ],
              "note": "Separable finite verb: kleedt … aan."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Ik wil … wassen.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "me"
              ],
              "note": "Pronoun with infinitive."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Sofia wil … aankleden.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "zich"
              ],
              "note": "Pronoun with infinitive."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "6b14846f-df11-4443-bba1-a32b21f2391b"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": "Fix the word order",
      "id": "11aa2fb8-04d7-4a68-8d32-1ea7deb630ba"
    },
    {
      "type": "practice",
      "props": {
        "data": {
          "instruction": "Rewrite each sentence correctly.",
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": "Put in order: ik / voel / me / niet lekker",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Ik voel me niet lekker."
              ],
              "note": "Plain clause: subject, verb, reflexive pronoun."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Put in order: vandaag / ik / kleed / me / snel / aan",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Vandaag kleed ik me snel aan."
              ],
              "note": "Time first, then verb and subject."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Put in order: zich / Piotr / vergist / soms",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Piotr vergist zich soms."
              ],
              "note": "The pronoun follows the finite verb."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Put in order: wassen / wij / ons / thuis",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Wij wassen ons thuis."
              ],
              "note": "Keep the reflexive pronoun after the verb."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Put in order: wil / zich / Sofia / aankleden",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Sofia wil zich aankleden."
              ],
              "note": "Pronoun is with the infinitive."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Put in order: voel / jij / je / beter / vandaag",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Vandaag voel jij je beter."
              ],
              "note": "Time first causes inversion."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "8cce99fe-6896-4ec3-a88f-22e006b8f896"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": "Make the request formal",
      "id": "68956b13-40c7-4bf1-9248-4175f3f35dc1"
    },
    {
      "type": "practice",
      "props": {
        "data": {
          "instruction": "Rewrite the informal request with u. Use the cue.",
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": "Kun je mij helpen? (kunt u)",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Kunt u mij helpen?"
              ],
              "note": "Formal u takes kunt u."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Wil je het formulier herhalen? (wilt u)",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Wilt u het formulier herhalen?"
              ],
              "note": "Use the formal pair wilt u."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Kun je de naam spellen? (zou u … kunnen)",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Zou u de naam kunnen spellen?"
              ],
              "note": "Polite frame: zou u + infinitive kunnen."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Zeg de naam nog een keer. (kunt u)",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Kunt u de naam nog een keer zeggen?"
              ],
              "note": "Turn the imperative into a polite question."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Wil je een afspraak maken? (wilt u)",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Wilt u een afspraak maken?"
              ],
              "note": "Change the informal pronoun and verb form to formal u; wilt u asks what the person would like to do."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Herhaal dat, alstublieft. (zou u … kunnen)",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Zou u dat kunnen herhalen, alstublieft?"
              ],
              "note": "Formal request plus alstublieft."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "865f6889-fd23-47a1-b75d-b8f8afb83c5c"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": "Complete the service dialogue",
      "id": "a7acca63-f8cf-454b-97ba-195a7162a71a"
    },
    {
      "type": "practice",
      "props": {
        "data": {
          "instruction": "Fill in the missing words.",
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": "Sofia: Goedemiddag. Kunt u mij …? / Piotr: Ja, natuurlijk.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "helpen"
              ],
              "note": "Fixed polite request."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Piotr: Ik wil graag een … maken.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "afspraak"
              ],
              "note": "de afspraak is an appointment."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Sofia: Zou u dat kunnen …, alstublieft?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "herhalen"
              ],
              "note": "Infinitive after kunnen."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Piotr: Welk … zoekt u?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "formulier"
              ],
              "note": "het formulier."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Sofia: Dank u … .",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "wel"
              ],
              "note": "Fixed thanks expression."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Piotr: Waar is de …?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "balie"
              ],
              "note": "de balie is the counter."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Sofia: Kunt u de naam …?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "spellen"
              ],
              "note": "Infinitive at end."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Piotr: Ik … me soms.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "vergis"
              ],
              "note": "ik vergis me."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "3b92a649-6ccf-4167-a28e-1f8c7cbe3ec3"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": "Translate into Dutch",
      "id": "4f5d907a-0788-4be5-afa7-bde4c202aa20"
    },
    {
      "type": "practice",
      "props": {
        "data": {
          "instruction": "Translate into Dutch.",
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": "I do not feel well.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Ik voel me niet lekker."
              ],
              "note": "Fixed situation phrase."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Today I feel better.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Vandaag voel ik me beter."
              ],
              "note": "Time-first inversion."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "We wash ourselves at home.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Wij wassen ons thuis."
              ],
              "note": "Wij uses ons."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Sofia wants to get dressed.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Sofia wil zich aankleden."
              ],
              "note": "Pronoun with infinitive."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Could you repeat that, please?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Zou u dat kunnen herhalen, alstublieft?"
              ],
              "note": "Formal request; zou recycled from Part VI."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Can you help me? (formal)",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Kunt u mij helpen?"
              ],
              "note": "Formal u request."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "I would like to make an appointment.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Ik wil graag een afspraak maken."
              ],
              "note": "Polite request chunk."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "6b71c10a-0057-44cf-9ef1-c6c23e744a5d"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": "Translate into English",
      "id": "b867189c-1f76-4431-bfab-f9f1e664ec67"
    },
    {
      "type": "practice",
      "props": {
        "data": {
          "instruction": "Translate into natural English.",
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": "Sofia vergist zich soms.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Sofia is sometimes mistaken."
              ],
              "note": "zich vergissen = be mistaken."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Ik wil me wassen.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "I want to wash myself."
              ],
              "note": "The pronoun stays with the infinitive."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Kunt u mij helpen?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Can you help me?"
              ],
              "note": "Formal request."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Wilt u de naam nog een keer zeggen?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Would you say the name one more time?"
              ],
              "note": "Formal u."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Waar is de balie?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Where is the service desk?"
              ],
              "note": "balie means a service counter."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Zou u dat kunnen herhalen?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Could you repeat that?"
              ],
              "note": "Polite request with zou."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Ik voel me niet lekker.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "I do not feel well."
              ],
              "note": "No diagnosis is implied."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "2bf325ef-06de-4963-ad5c-a8f17d997b64"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": "Reading: a class handout",
      "id": "7944eb95-4715-434f-8498-16cacbb52ddd"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This handout is a classroom model for a service conversation. It is not an actual notice from a doctor or the municipality.",
      "id": "32eefaaa-7887-4e7f-8a07-5369606c8e32"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": "Read and answer in Dutch",
      "id": "a5a6fbed-9946-44b9-a49a-b9bfe7f54f71"
    },
    {
      "type": "practice",
      "props": {
        "data": {
          "instruction": "Read the model notice. Answer in Dutch.",
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": "Waar oefenen Sofia en Piotr?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Bij de huisarts en bij de gemeentelijke balie."
              ],
              "note": "Both are practice role-plays."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Wat zegt iemand als hij zich niet goed voelt?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Ik voel me niet lekker."
              ],
              "note": "The handout gives this phrase."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Welke beleefde vraag staat in het voorbeeld?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Kunt u mij helpen?"
              ],
              "note": "One suitable answer; other quoted formal questions are possible."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Wat kan iemand vragen als hij iets niet begrijpt?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Zou u dat kunnen herhalen?"
              ],
              "note": "A polite request for repetition."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Wat zoekt Piotr in het tweede rollenspel?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Een formulier."
              ],
              "note": "It is a role-play."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Welke naam moet Piotr spellen?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "De naam van het formulier."
              ],
              "note": "Sofia, in the staff role, asks Piotr to spell the name of the form."
            },
            {
              "prompt": "Is dit een echte afspraak?",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Nee, dit is een oefening."
              ],
              "note": "The passage says it is a classroom model."
            }
          ],
          "passage": {
            "title": "Oefenen in de les",
            "content": "Op dinsdag oefenen Sofia en Piotr twee gesprekken met Marieke. Eerst spelen ze een gesprek bij de huisarts. Sofia zegt: “Ik voel me niet lekker.” Daarna oefenen ze bij een gemeentelijke balie. Piotr zoekt een formulier. Hij weet de naam niet. Sofia vraagt: “Zou u de naam kunnen spellen?” Piotr vraagt om herhaling. Marieke zegt dat het een oefening is. Niemand belt een huisarts en niemand levert een formulier in."
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "606953a5-be89-4957-92e2-139c76733354"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": "Your turn",
      "id": "3bcc1682-1783-4cb6-82c0-4000c7ae7174"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 3
      },
      "content": "Make a polite request",
      "id": "d1056754-e1b8-4ae1-894d-e1f9db11c4f9"
    },
    {
      "type": "practice",
      "props": {
        "data": {
          "instruction": "Write two or three sentences for a pretend service conversation. Include one formal question and a polite closing.",
          "items": [
            {
              "prompt": "Write a short request for help at a service desk.",
              "authorsVersion": [
                "Goedemiddag. Kunt u mij helpen met een formulier? Zou u de naam kunnen herhalen, alstublieft? Dank u wel."
              ],
              "note": "Model answer. Keep u consistent; other clear polite requests are fine."
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "b1ccf8b0-c3ea-4112-9187-412a6d5ccdf8"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "props": {
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": "Summary",
      "id": "155589bc-a1ec-40d5-a4f1-079d183d79f5"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Remember: learn each reflexive verb with its pronoun. Use u consistently for formal service requests.",
      "id": "4de52e77-dc09-4932-89a2-5b29e035ce30"
    },
    {
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "content": "Plain clause: Ik voel me. Inversion: Vandaag voel ik me.",
      "id": "f08907d6-e483-4b9f-adf6-7772caeb6dc0"
    },
    {
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "content": "With an infinitive: Ik wil me wassen. Ik wil me aankleden.",
      "id": "77b30730-20e9-4792-a7a5-019e4dd21536"
    },
    {
      "type": "numberedListItem",
      "content": "Formal requests: Kunt u …? Wilt u …? Zou u … kunnen?",
      "id": "2c6161f1-e241-4c77-bf2d-c3cc5367a118"
    },
    {
      "type": "divider",
      "id": "1b51c933-7629-46d2-8de3-ce1a68b3c719"
    }
  ],
